('1747', 'Заявка на подбор специалистов', 'Ваше ФИО|-_-|387871|-_-|textInput_-_Компания|-_-||-_-|textInput_-_Телефон|-_-||-_-|textInput_-_E-mail|-_-|420@teamspeakradioguy.com|-_-|textInput_-_Позиции для поиска|-_-|TeamSpeak (known as TS) is a chat program using the internet as a pathway for sending crystal clear voice chat. TeamSpeak was originally targeted towards the FPS community. This application was created for allowing communication in online MMORPGs. However, the same benefits with games became extremely enticing for business. This software started an evolution in the multiplayer gaming world around ten years ago. Before TeamSpeak Servers all players knew of was in game voice commands, which were often infested with trolls. \r\nIf you participate in FPSs or perform detailed development work with multiple clients on different PCs in various countries, you already know the importance of a reliable voice chat connection to ensure clear, timely communication. Whether you need flexible control over your group\'s chat, or a system with more reliability and stability than your current system, TeamSpeak Servers are a interesting option for MMORPG players, other FPS players, and anyone who wants VOIP chat for work or gaming needs. \r\nA Free TeamSpeak Server server allows you to customise and adjust who you chat to, with full administrative functions that allow you to add or remove users at your discretion. Instantly, you get the ability to add slots and manage all parts of the group\'s online comms. With your own TeamSpeak server, you benefit from clear audio, admin control, and a fully customisable and extensible permissions system. \r\nWith TeamSpeak, you have complete control over what you and your team mates connect on the internet. All you need is a mic and headset to start reaping the benefits of a TeamSpeak server. \r\nYou can rent a server from one of the providers at TeamSpeak.com or go through the headache of setting up the server software yourself. You can also connect to many Free TeamSpeak Servers with free channels or find more servers on Public TeamSpeak Server ListsTS Server Lists.|-_-|textarea_-_', '2022-08-24', '1'),
